# Design

Vision Studio is a dark analytics dashboard with a warm ember accent. The ground is `#0B0A09`, with a film grain overlay around 2.5% opacity and a faint warm radial glow behind the main column. Cards are `#141210`, with a 1px border `rgba(255,140,80,0.10)` and an inner gradient from `rgba(255,106,43,0.05)` to transparent. Raised controls are `#1C1915`. Primary text is `#F2EDE8`. Secondary text is `#A39B92`. On ember `#FF6A2B`, text is `#0B0A09`. On `#5A2410`, text is `#F2EDE8`. Text pairs are at least 4.5 to 1. `#6E675F` is for non-text marks only. Quiet readable copy uses `#A39B92`.

Ember `#FF6A2B` is the accent, focus, primary actions, and the playhead. `#FF9A5C` is for gradients and the ready light. `#5A2410` is a filled background. Status lights: ready `#FF9A5C`, thinking `#FFB020` blinking, error `#FF4D3D`. A thin hazard stripe may run on the top edge of a card while thinking or rendering. No scanlines on text. Lane colours appear only on the audio dot and on a selected layer pill: drums `#C45A4A`, chords `#C9A15A`, bass `#3D8F78`, melody `#5D7EC4`, texture `#8A6BB8`. Waveforms use an ember gradient. Full mix has no sixth hue.

General Sans is the interface. Martian Mono is readout values, file names, and the trace. Both are self hosted. Sentence case. No all caps. Tabular numbers. Eyebrow 12px medium in ember, page title 32px semibold, card titles 16px semibold, body 14px, readout values 28px with a faint ember glow. Icons are lucide, and every icon button has a label or a tooltip.

Cards are 16px radius, controls 10px, pills fully round. Card gaps are 24px. Card padding is 20px. Spacing stays on a 4px grid. Hover and focus use a soft ember glow. Motion is 150 to 200ms. Reduced motion stops the hazard stripe and holds the thinking light steady.

The layout is a 12 column grid, at most 1600px. The sidebar is 240px: wordmark, rooms with icons (Create, Genres, Analyse and Tweak with a Soon pill), recent ideas with a waveform icon, a tip, and Help. It collapses to icons under 1280px, with tooltips. The header is the eyebrow "Create", the title "Shape your idea", the subtitle, the status light, Build now, and one Build button. Four readout tiles follow: Tempo, Key, Bars, Brief coverage. Empty values say "auto" and "set from your words". Source pills read you, detected, or auto. Reference stays reference. Conversation is 8 columns, brief is 4. Messages are bubbles. The composer is docked in the conversation card. The brief groups Locked, From you, Detected, and Defaults, with lock icons on locked facts, then layer pills that stay colourless until selected. Under 1024px the two cards stack, the tiles become 2 by 2, and the brief can collapse to a summary row. Results are one row per layer. A sticky player holds Play together and Export to Logic. An insight card offers one next step whose label is not a demo button label.

The question bubble is the only polite live region. Send's accessible name is "Send the idea". Exactly one button reads "Build". The All layers pill does not read "all layers separately". `data-variant` stays on every take. The composer stays mounted.
